<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plastall changes name to Gundle.</title>
<headline>Plastall changes name to Gundle.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging and print firm Plastall Ltd confirmed on Monday that it had changed its name to Gundle Ltd with effect from April 7.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
